OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FDown on his luck, Hans Fenger
OL,7,     Ffound joy teaching kids rock
OL,8,     Fsongs. His ragtag band recorded an
OL,9,     Funlikely hit album - loved by
OL,10,     FDavid Bowie - and inspired the
OL,11,     Ffilm School of Rock.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1976, schoolchildren marched
OL,14,     Fthrough Soweto to protest against
OL,15,     Fa decision by the South African
OL,16,     Fgovernment to force them to study
OL,17,     Fin Afrikaans.
